recommend keep-going both DC removers now stand together — the memoryless block mean for a bounded region, the carried-state IIR blocker for a stream — and the offset family the DRIVE shelf generates is fully answered; the loop names its own next Lotus crux (a hysteresis comparator giving lotus-audio's square a memory against chatter, a carried-state shelving IIR, or a fresh DSP family) as its own self-approved design round
